total_overcharge_usd | total_undercharge_usd | net_revenue_impact_usd |
absolute_revenue_impact_usd | failed_account_count
total_overcharge_usd: sum of positive revenue_impact_usd values.
total_undercharge_usd: absolute sum of negative revenue_impact_usd values (positive number).
All metric values must be numeric.
exception_review.csv — one row per approval record:
account_id | approval_id | exception_type | expiry_date | is_valid_on_migration_date
| applied_to_expected_result | review_status
review_status allowed values: valid_applied, expired_not_applied, superseded_not_applied,
not_applicable
